 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-03-03",
   "text": "Save Oak Flat From Foreign Mining Act\n This bill withdraws Oak Flat (which consists of 2,422 acres of Forest System land in the Tonto National Forest in southeastern Arizona) from mining activity. The bill repeals authorization for Oak Flat to be exchanged for land held by Resolution Copper Mining, LLC."
  }
